@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# PocketPy 2.1.8
+
+Release assets `pocketpy.c` / `pocketpy.h` from
+https://github.com/pocketpy/pocketpy/releases/tag/v2.1.8 (MIT, see `LICENSE`).
+
+Upstream SHA-256:
+
+- `pocketpy.c` 78788bfc789c986cc67b2d1ca9cb5b6e08d4c6661cb433fcc5f99ab69b0afdf6
+- `pocketpy.h` b27e264e6dd3a7597f75452ee7980879cfcae88b0782d0b4ce0ad9315781f7b1
+
+Built with `PK_ENABLE_OS=0` (no `os`/`io`, files, sockets, `system()`, `dlopen`),
+`PK_ENABLE_THREADS=0` and `PK_ENABLE_WATCHDOG=1` (see `../../BUILD`).
+
+## Local changes
+
+1. `str__getitem__`: an integer index is normalized by the string's length in characters
+   (`c11_sv__u8_length`) instead of bytes. Upstream normalized `"Привет"[-1]` against the byte
+   length, read past the string and aborted the process. Re-check before updating.
+
+Upstream `json.loads` rejects `\uXXXX` and `\/` escapes; `AyuPythonEngine.c` turns them into plain
+UTF-8 before JSON reaches Python.
