+Capture on iPhone 17 / iOS 26.5 at 3x, using the pinned Xcode toolchain.
+Run //submodules/SettingsUI:AyuSettingsSnapshotTests. It attaches all 60 rendered PNGs
+and fails for each missing baseline. Export the attachments from the xcresult,
+inspect text, clipping, light/dark colours and Russian/English layouts, then place
+the approved PNGs here with their attachment names. Re-run without changing them.
+Do not auto-accept new images on failure. No baseline was generated on Linux.
+The test calls TelegramUI's real MessageShot renderer and renders the actual list
+node; a missing renderer must not produce an accepted empty MessageShot preview.
